  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-58d36e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the sweet potato is roasting, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Pick thyme leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-08d7c310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5 minutes. Add garlic, thyme and garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add risotto-style rice and stir to coat. Add the water and stock concentrate, then bring to the boil.\n• Remove from heat, then transfer risotto to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil and bake in the oven until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-c356dd20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the risotto has 15 minutes cook time remaining, roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil and the butter.\n• Add sliced mushrooms and cook, stirring until well browned, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add silverbeet and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-b3ffb130.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove risotto from the oven. Add a splash of water to loosen the risotto.\n• Gently stir in roasted sweet potato and cooked veggies. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-056dbe40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the roasted sweet potato and mushroom risotto between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds and Parmesan cheese (see ingredients) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-e74cf150.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
